          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens kaka and starts talking." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开 kaka 并开始说话。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打開 kaka 並開始說話。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens kaka and starts talking. If kaka is doing a task, it shows that task and leaves it running." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开 kaka 并开始说话。kaka 正在做任务时，显示这个任务，任务继续进行。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打開 kaka 並開始說話。kaka 正在做任務時，顯示這個任務，任務繼續進行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "kaka couldn’t start the task. The chat says why." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "kaka 没能开始这个任务，原因在聊天里。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "kaka 沒能開始這個任務，原因在聊天裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "kaka is still busy, so this task didn’t start. Here is what kaka is doing." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "kaka 还在忙，这个任务没有开始。这里是 kaka 正在做的事。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "kaka 還在忙，這個任務沒有開始。這裡是 kaka 正在做的事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "kaka started the task. Turn kaka on so it can act on the phone." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "kaka 已开始这个任务。开启 kaka 后它才能操作手机。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "kaka 已開始這個任務。開啟 kaka 後它才能操作手機。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "kaka starts the task on this iPhone and tells you when it is done." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "kaka 在这台 iPhone 上开始做这个任务，做完后告诉你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "kaka 在這台 iPhone 上開始做這個任務，做完後告訴你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "kaka wasn’t ready. Try again in a moment." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "kaka 还没准备好，请稍后再试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "kaka 還沒準備好，請稍後再試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press and hold the Action button to open kaka and start talking. To type a task instead, choose Shortcut there, then Send Task. Control Center and the Lock Screen can hold Talk to kaka too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按住操作按钮，就会打开 kaka 并开始说话。想改成输入任务，就在那里选「快捷指令」，再选「发任务」。控制中心和锁定屏幕也可以放「和 kaka 说话」。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按住動作按鈕，就會打開 kaka 並開始說話。想改成輸入任務，就在那裡選「捷徑」，再選「發任務」。控制中心和鎖定畫面也可以放「和 kaka 說話」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
